#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:1
msgid "The Public Path Table"
msgstr "公开路径表"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:3
msgid ""
"HybridInference ships two long-running HTTP services: the FastAPI gateway"
" (`apps/backend`) and a Next.js console (`apps/frontend`). Only one of "
"them needs to be reachable from the internet."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference 包含两个常驻的 HTTP 服务：FastAPI 网关（`apps/backend`）和 Next.js "
"控制台（`apps/frontend`）。只有其中一个需要暴露到公网。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:7
msgid ""
"**`deploy/public-paths.json` is the public path table.** It lists every "
"public path that is not one of the console's own pages, and what serves "
"it. The console is its default implementation: it is the process that "
"terminates public traffic, and it forwards the gateway's paths through "
"App Router route handlers, apart from a few that only answer `GET`, which"
" are static rewrites in the `rewrites()` configuration in "
"`apps/frontend/next.config.js`; the cloud agent and pgAdmin have route "
"handlers of their own. Anything not named by either mechanism is served "
"by the console's own pages."
msgstr ""
"**`deploy/public-paths.json` "
"就是公开路径表**。它列出除控制台自身页面之外的每一条公开路径，以及由谁提供。控制台是它的默认实现：公网流量终止在控制台这个进程上，网关的路径由它通过"
" App Router 的 route handler 转发，只有少数只响应 `GET` 的路径例外，它们是 "
"`apps/frontend/next.config.js` 里 `rewrites()` 配置中的静态 rewrite；cloud agent "
"和 pgAdmin 也各有自己的 route handler。两种机制都没列出的路径，由控制台自己的页面来响应。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:16
msgid ""
"A deployment's entry — its CDN, tunnel or load balancer — may instead "
"send the paths the manifest marks `entry_split`, today `/v1` and "
"`/anthropic`, straight to the gateway, so that a console release or "
"restart no longer interrupts inference requests. That is the deployment's"
" choice and is made in its own entry; this repository ships no entry "
"configuration. The console keeps forwarding those prefixes either way, "
"and removing the entry's rules sends the traffic back through it. The "
"conditions such an entry has to meet are in [Splitting inference traffic "
"at the entry](deployment.md#splitting-inference-traffic-at-the-entry)."
msgstr ""
"部署的入口——它的 CDN、隧道或负载均衡——也可以把清单里标记了 `entry_split` 的路径（目前是 `/v1` 和 "
"`/anthropic`）直接交给网关，这样控制台的发布或重启就不再打断推理请求。这由部署自己决定，在它自己的入口上配置；本仓库不提供任何入口配置。无论哪种方式，控制台都继续转发这两个前缀，撤掉入口上的规则，流量就回到控制台。这样的入口必须满足的条件见[在入口分流推理流量](deployment.md"
"#splitting-inference-traffic-at-the-entry)。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:25
msgid ""
"So exposing the console's port exposes every gateway path in the table "
"below. Outside the split prefixes, publishing a new path means adding it "
"to the manifest and editing `next.config.js` or adding a route handler — "
"not changing the reverse proxy or tunnel in front. Under a split prefix, "
"every gateway route is already public on both topologies, since the "
"console relays the whole prefix too: a new route there needs no entry "
"change either. Only adding or moving a split prefix changes an entry, and"
" the [probe](deployment.md#checking-an-entry-split-with-the-probe) has to"
" be run again when it does. A path missing from both the handlers and the"
" rewrites gets the console's HTML 404 page, which an API client will read"
" as \"the gateway is down\" rather than \"this path is not forwarded\"."
msgstr ""
"所以，暴露控制台的端口，就等于暴露了下表中的每一条网关路径。在分流前缀之外，公开一条新路径意味着把它加进清单，并改 "
"`next.config.js` 或新增一个 route "
"handler，而不是去改前面的反向代理或隧道。在分流前缀之内，每一条网关路由在两种拓扑下都已经公开，因为控制台同样转发整个前缀：在那里新增路由也不需要改入口。只有新增或移动分流前缀时才需要改入口，而且这时必须重新运行[探针](deployment.md"
"#checking-an-entry-split-with-the-probe)。route handler 和 rewrite "
"都没有的路径会得到控制台的 HTML 404 页面——在 API 客户端看来，这更像「网关挂了」，而不是「这个路径没有被转发」。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:47
msgid "The manifest"
msgstr "清单"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:49
msgid "Each entry of `deploy/public-paths.json` has four fields:"
msgstr "`deploy/public-paths.json` 的每个条目有四个字段："

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`path`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"The public path. A segment written `:name` stands for any one segment: "
"`/internal/users/:userId/status`"
msgstr "公开路径。写作 `:name` 的一段代表任意一段：`/internal/users/:userId/status`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`match`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"`prefix`: the path itself or anything below it, so `/v1` covers `/v1` and"
" `/v1/...` but not `/v10`. `exact`: the path alone. Either is judged "
"after dot segments are resolved, as the console's `isUnder()` judges it"
msgstr ""
"`prefix`：路径本身或它下面的任何路径，所以 `/v1` 覆盖 `/v1` 和 `/v1/...`，但不覆盖 "
"`/v10`。`exact`：只有路径本身。两者都在解析完点号段之后判断，与控制台的 `isUnder()` 一致"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`owner`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"What serves it: `gateway`, `console` (a route handler of the console's "
"own, such as `/healthz` and `/site-assets`), `cloud-agent` or `pgadmin`"
msgstr ""
"由谁提供：`gateway`、`console`（控制台自己的 route handler，例如 `/healthz` 和 `/site-"
"assets`）、`cloud-agent` 或 `pgadmin`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`entry_split`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"`true` when a deployment's entry may send the path straight to the "
"gateway. Only `/v1` and `/anthropic` are"
msgstr "为 `true` 时，部署的入口可以把该路径直接交给网关。只有 `/v1` 和 `/anthropic` 是"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:58
msgid ""
"A gateway path that is not in the manifest must not be reachable from the"
" internet — FastAPI's `/docs`, `/redoc` and `/openapi.json`, "
"`/health/deep`, `/health/ready`, `/health/model-activity` and every "
"`/internal` route not listed. On the console's topology nothing forwards "
"them. An entry that splits off a prefix has to hold the same line (rules "
"E1 and E7 in the deployment guide)."
msgstr ""
"不在清单里的网关路径不得从公网到达——FastAPI 的 `/docs`、`/redoc` 和 "
"`/openapi.json`，`/health/deep`、`/health/ready`、`/health/model-"
"activity`，以及每一条没有列出的 `/internal` "
"路由。在控制台的拓扑下，没有任何东西转发它们。分流出某个前缀的入口必须守住同样的边界（部署指南里的 E1 和 E7）。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:65
msgid ""
"The console's routing cannot read the manifest: route handlers are files,"
" `rewrites()` and `redirects()` are compiled at build time, and the "
"middleware's `matcher` must be a literal string, because Next reads it "
"without running the module. Tests hold each of them to the manifest "
"instead, and fail when one changes without the others:"
msgstr ""
"控制台的路由读不了清单：route handler 是文件，`rewrites()` 和 `redirects()` 在构建时编译，中间件的 "
"`matcher` 必须是字面量字符串，因为 Next "
"读取它时不运行模块。所以改由测试让它们各自与清单保持一致，其中任何一处单独改动，测试都会失败："

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:71
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/next.config.public-paths.test.ts` checks that every "
"gateway entry is served by exactly one route handler or one rewrite, that"
" the middleware's `matcher` leaves out exactly the manifest's first "
"segments, and that the trailing-slash rule in `redirects()` covers "
"exactly the segments it should. `/healthz` is the one manifest path the "
"middleware still sees."
msgstr ""
"`apps/frontend/next.config.public-paths.test.ts` 检查：每个网关条目恰好由一个 route "
"handler 或一个 rewrite 提供；中间件的 `matcher` 恰好排除清单里的各个第一段；`redirects()` "
"里的尾斜杠规则恰好覆盖应覆盖的那些段。`/healthz` 是中间件仍然会看到的唯一一条清单路径。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:76
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/src/lib/server/gatewayRoutes.test.ts` checks its own list "
"of gateway route files against the manifest."
msgstr ""
"`apps/frontend/src/lib/server/gatewayRoutes.test.ts` 把它自己的网关 route "
"文件列表与清单比对。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:78
msgid ""
"`tests/unit/middleware/test_trailing_slash.py` checks that the gateway's "
"own trailing-slash redirect covers exactly the `entry_split` prefixes."
msgstr ""
"`tests/unit/middleware/test_trailing_slash.py` 检查网关自己的尾斜杠重定向恰好覆盖 "
"`entry_split` 前缀。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:81
msgid ""
"The rewrites, the redirect rule and the matcher work per first segment "
"(`internal`, not `/internal/verify-admin`); which `/internal` paths are "
"published is decided by the route files, one per path."
msgstr ""
"rewrite、重定向规则和 matcher 都按第一段工作（`internal`，而不是 `/internal/verify-"
"admin`）；哪些 `/internal` 路径被公开，由 route 文件决定，每条路径一个文件。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:30
msgid "The path table"
msgstr "路径表"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:87
msgid ""
"Two of the manifest's paths are the console's own and reach nothing "
"behind it: `/healthz`, the container health check "
"(`src/app/healthz/route.ts`), which answers `200 ok` without asking the "
"gateway, and `/site-assets`, the Site UI module's images, served from "
"files packaged into the console image (`src/app/site-"
"assets/[[...path]]/route.ts`). `/health` is the gateway's check, "
"forwarded."
msgstr ""
"清单里有两条路径属于控制台自己，不通往它后面的任何服务：`/healthz`，容器健康检查（`src/app/healthz/route.ts`），不询问网关就回答"
" `200 ok`；以及 `/site-assets`，Site UI 模块的图片，由打包进控制台镜像的文件提供（`src/app/site-"
"assets/[[...path]]/route.ts`）。`/health` 是网关的检查，被转发过去。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:32
msgid ""
"The table below combines the static rewrites with the filesystem route "
"handlers. `apps/frontend/next.config.js` is the source of truth for "
"rewrites; the matching `route.ts` file is the source of truth for a "
"runtime handler."
msgstr ""
"下表把静态 rewrite 和文件系统里的 route handler 放在一起列出。rewrite 以 "
"`apps/frontend/next.config.js` 为准；运行时 handler 以对应的 `route.ts` 文件为准。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:36
msgid ""
"Destination resolution is deliberately split. Next resolves `rewrites()` "
"at **build** time and writes them into `.next/routes-manifest.json`. "
"Route handlers read their server-only environment at request time, so "
"changing those targets requires recreating the container, not rebuilding "
"the image."
msgstr ""
"目标地址的解析时机是有意分开的。Next 在**构建**时解析 `rewrites()`，并写进 `.next/routes-"
"manifest.json`；route handler "
"则在请求到来时读取只在服务端可见的环境变量，所以改这些目标只需重新创建容器，不用重新构建镜像。"

