#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:78
msgid ""
"`/agents/api/:path*` is matched before `/agents/:path*`. The first is a "
"prefix of the second, so with the order reversed every API call is "
"answered with the web app's HTML."
msgstr ""
"`/agents/api/:path*` 会先于 `/agents/:path*` 匹配。前者是后者的前缀，顺序反过来的话，每个 API "
"调用拿到的都会是网页应用的 HTML。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:81
msgid ""
"The handler streams request and response bodies, including SSE, but it "
"cannot accept WebSocket upgrades. A future WebSocket endpoint needs an "
"upgrade-aware proxy in front of Next.js."
msgstr ""
"这个 handler 会流式转发请求体和响应体，包括 SSE，但不支持 WebSocket 升级。以后如果要加 WebSocket 端点，需要在 "
"Next.js 前面放一个支持协议升级的代理。"

