#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:98
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each handler forwards to `${BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL}` plus the same path, "
"provided that path, once its dot segments are resolved, is still under the "
"handler's own prefix; anything else is answered with a 404. "
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` is the address fixed at build time, the same one the "
"rewrites use. The code that does the forwarding is "
"`src/lib/server/gatewayProxy.ts`. A rewrite would also fail these paths' "
"responses, in three ways:"
msgstr ""
"每个 handler 都转发到 `${BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL}` 加上同样的路径，前提是这个路径在解析掉其中的点段之后，仍然位于这个 "
"handler 自己的前缀之下；不满足的一律回答 404。`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` 是构建时固定下来的地址，和 rewrite "
"用的是同一个。负责转发的代码在 `src/lib/server/gatewayProxy.ts`。对这些路径的响应，rewrite "
"还会在三个方面出问题："

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:104
msgid ""
"When the gateway drops a connection after the response has started (a "
"crash, a restart or a deploy), Next's rewrite proxy never ends the "
"caller's response. The caller then waits until something in front of the "
"console gives up."
msgstr "响应开始之后，如果网关那边的连接断了（崩溃、重启或部署），Next 的 rewrite 代理不会结束发给调用方的响应。调用方会一直等，直到控制台前面的某一层放弃为止。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:108
msgid ""
"The rewrite proxy ends a response after 30 seconds with no data. The handler"
" sets no deadline of its own: the gateway limits every request itself, and "
"streaming responses send a keepalive every 15 seconds. It only closes a "
"connection that has carried nothing in either direction for an hour."
msgstr ""
"rewrite 代理在 30 秒没有数据后就会结束响应。handler 不设自己的期限：网关自己会限制每个请求的时长，流式响应每 15 "
"秒还会发一次保活。它只会关闭一条在两个方向上都已经一小时没有任何数据的连接。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:111
msgid ""
"A failure comes back as Next's plain-text 500. The handler answers a "
"gateway it cannot reach with a JSON 502."
msgstr "出错时 rewrite 返回的是 Next 自己的纯文本 500。handler 连不上网关时，返回 JSON 格式的 502。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:114
msgid ""
"The handler sends the gateway the same request the rewrite did. Every "
"request header is forwarded except the hop-by-hop ones, `Host` names the "
"gateway, and `X-Forwarded-Host` carries the caller's host. A body's framing "
"is the handler's own: it declares the length of the body it actually sends, "
"or sends it chunked, never a length the caller declared for a body Next did "
"not pass on. The forwarding headers travel exactly as the caller sent them; "
"the handler adds no address of its own, because a route handler cannot see "
"the connection's once the caller has sent `X-Forwarded-For`. When the caller"
" sent no `X-Forwarded-For`, `-Proto` or `-Port`, Next fills them in from the"
" connection. Before trusting any of them, see [Behind the "
"console](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md#behind-the-console). When the "
"caller hangs up, the gateway's request is cancelled at once."
msgstr ""
"handler 发给网关的请求和 rewrite 一样：除了逐跳（hop-by-hop）头，所有请求头都会转发；`Host` "
"指向网关，`X-Forwarded-Host` 带着调用方的主机名。请求体的分帧由 handler "
"自己决定：它声明的是它实际发送的请求体的长度，或者用分块传输发送，绝不会沿用调用方为一个 Next "
"并没有传下来的请求体所声明的长度。转发类的头完全按调用方发来的样子传过去；handler 不会加上自己的地址，因为调用方一旦带了 "
"`X-Forwarded-For`，route handler 就看不到这条连接的地址。调用方没有带 "
"`X-Forwarded-For`、`-Proto` 或 `-Port` 时，Next "
"会根据连接自己补上。在信任其中任何一个之前，请先看[在控制台后面](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md#behind-the-console)。调用方一断开，发往网关的请求会立即取消。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:121
msgid "Legacy `beforeFiles` compatibility"
msgstr "旧版 `beforeFiles` 兼容"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:123
msgid ""
"`next.config.js` still emits the same three rules as `beforeFiles` rewrites "
"when both agent URLs are supplied **while building** the image, as some "
"older distribution pipelines do. This repository's Compose does not pass "
"them, and its images use the runtime handler above. Because `beforeFiles` "
"wins over a filesystem route, an image built with those values keeps its "
"baked-in targets and cannot be retargeted by changing only the container "
"environment. Such an image also keeps `middlewareClientMaxBodySize` at 32 "
"MiB, because those rewrites carry the agent's request bodies."
msgstr ""
"如果在**构建**镜像时同时提供了两个 agent URL（一些较旧的发行版流水线就是这么做的），`next.config.js` "
"仍会把同样的三条规则生成为 `beforeFiles` rewrite。本仓库的 Compose 不传这两个值，它的镜像用的是上面的运行时 "
"handler。由于 `beforeFiles` "
"的优先级高于文件系统路由，用这些值构建出的镜像会保留构建时写死的目标地址，只改容器的环境变量无法让它指向新目标。这样的镜像还会把 "
"`middlewareClientMaxBodySize` 保持在 32 MiB，因为这些 rewrite 要转发 agent 的请求体。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:130
msgid "`afterFiles` — the gateway"
msgstr "`afterFiles`——网关"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:132
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Every destination below is `${BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL}` plus the same path. "
"These paths only answer `GET`, so a rewrite has no body to copy; of whatever"
" a caller sends anyway, Next keeps at most `middlewareClientMaxBodySize` (16"
" KiB)."
msgstr ""
"下面每一条的目标都是 `${BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL}` 加上同样的路径。这些路径只响应 `GET`，所以 rewrite "
"没有请求体可复制；就算调用方硬要发来请求体，Next 最多也只保留 `middlewareClientMaxBodySize`（16 KiB）。"

