#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:151
msgid ""
"Note on `/internal`: each published path has a route file of its own rather "
"than one handler for all of `/internal`, and that is deliberate. The prefix "
"is shared — `/internal/verify-admin` authenticates a browser session by "
"cookie — so a catch-all would publish whatever route lands under `/internal`"
" next without anyone deciding it should be reachable from outside. "
"`/internal/agent-grants` is the one exception granted a whole sub-prefix, "
"because every route on that router carries a dispatch-token dependency at "
"the router level and so is authorized by construction."
msgstr ""
"关于 `/internal`：每个公开的路径都有自己的 route 文件，而不是由一个 handler 包揽整个 "
"`/internal`，这是有意为之。这个前缀是多方共用的（`/internal/verify-admin` 就靠 cookie "
"认证浏览器会话），一个兜底的 handler 会把以后新加到 `/internal` "
"下的路由直接暴露出去，而没有人专门决定过它该不该能从外部访问。`/internal/agent-grants` 是唯一放开整个子前缀的例外：那个 "
"router 在 router 层给每条路由都加了 dispatch token 依赖，从结构上就保证了都要鉴权。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:160
msgid "Why `/pgadmin` is a route handler and not a rewrite"
msgstr "为什么 `/pgadmin` 是 route handler 而不是 rewrite"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:162
msgid ""
"This section is for contributors who need to write a route handler of "
"their own; the pgAdmin proxy is the worked example."
msgstr "本节写给需要自己写 route handler 的贡献者；pgAdmin 代理就是现成的示例。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:165
msgid ""
"pgAdmin must only be reachable by an admin. **A rewrite cannot "
"authenticate** — it is a static mapping evaluated before any of your code"
" runs, with no way to call out, inspect a session, or refuse. So "
"`/pgadmin` is not in the table at all. It is an app route, "
"`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`, which is a "
"filesystem route and therefore wins over `afterFiles` rewrites. The "
"handler proxies to pgAdmin itself, after checking the caller."
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 只能让管理员访问。**rewrite "
"做不了鉴权**——它只是一条静态映射，在你的任何代码运行之前就已经求值，既不能向外发请求，也不能检查会话或拒绝请求。所以 `/pgadmin` "
"根本不在上面的表里，而是一条应用路由 "
"`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`。它属于文件系统路由，因此优先于 "
"`afterFiles` 里的 rewrite。这个 handler 先检查调用方，再自己把请求代理给 pgAdmin。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:173
msgid ""
"The handler is a compact worked example of an authenticated reverse proxy"
" in a Next.js route handler, and every one of its decisions generalizes:"
msgstr ""
"这个 handler 是个短小的例子，演示了怎样在 Next.js route handler "
"里实现带鉴权的反向代理，它的每个设计决定都能推广到别处："

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:176
msgid ""
"**Fail closed.** `verifyAdmin()` calls `GET /internal/verify-admin` on "
"the gateway with the caller's cookie and a 5-second timeout. Only an "
"explicit `200` admits. A backend that is down, slow, or answering "
"something unexpected denies. It assumes it is the only thing standing in "
"front of a database console, because it cannot tell whether pgAdmin has "
"its own login (that depends on `PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE`, which a "
"deployment can set to `False`)."
msgstr ""
"**失败即拒绝（fail closed）**。`verifyAdmin()` 带着调用方的 cookie、以 5 秒超时调用网关上的 `GET "
"/internal/verify-admin`。只有明确返回 `200` "
"才放行。后端挂了、响应慢，或者返回了意料之外的内容，一律拒绝。它假定自己是数据库控制台前面唯一的一道关，因为它没法判断 pgAdmin "
"自己有没有登录（这取决于 `PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE`，部署可以把它设为 `False`）。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:182
msgid ""
"**Strip the console's own session cookie** before forwarding. pgAdmin has"
" no use for it, and forwarding a session credential to a proxied app is "
"how those leak."
msgstr "转发前**去掉控制台自己的会话 cookie**。pgAdmin 用不到它；把会话凭据转发给被代理的应用，凭据就是这样泄漏的。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:185
msgid ""
"**Drop hop-by-hop headers** (RFC 9110 §7.6.1) plus `host` and `content-"
"length`, which `fetch` derives from the outgoing request. Drop `content-"
"encoding` on the way back, because `fetch` already decompressed the body."
" Re-split `Set-Cookie` with `getSetCookie()` — `Headers.forEach` folds "
"repeated values into one string."
msgstr ""
"**丢掉逐跳（hop-by-hop）头**（RFC 9110 §7.6.1），外加 `host` 和 `content-length`——这两个头"
" `fetch` 会根据要发出的请求自己算出来。返回时要丢掉 `content-encoding`，因为 `fetch` 已经把 body "
"解压过了。用 `getSetCookie()` 重新拆分 `Set-Cookie`——`Headers.forEach` "
"会把重复的值合并成一个字符串。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:190
msgid ""
"**Fold upstream-absolute redirects back to bare paths.** When a request "
"arrives without a trailing slash a route requires, Werkzeug builds an "
"absolute redirect from the `Host` it saw — here the internal container "
"name, which resolves nowhere in a browser. `foldUpstreamRedirect()` "
"rewrites those to a path, matching on hostname rather than origin so it "
"holds whatever port is on the URL."
msgstr ""
"**把上游返回的绝对地址重定向改回纯路径**。如果请求缺少某条路由要求的尾斜杠，Werkzeug 会用它看到的 `Host` "
"拼出一个绝对地址的重定向——在这里就是内部容器名，浏览器根本解析不了。`foldUpstreamRedirect()` "
"会把这类地址改写成路径；它按 hostname 而不是 origin 匹配，所以不管 URL 里带的是什么端口都能处理。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:196
msgid ""
"**Redirect with a bare path, not an absolute URL.** Behind a tunnel the "
"app sees its own bind address as `Host`, so `new URL('/login', "
"request.nextUrl)` renders as `https://0.0.0.0:3001/login` and strands the"
" browser. The handler writes the `Location` header by hand, since "
"`NextResponse.redirect()` accepts only absolute URLs."
msgstr ""
"**重定向用纯路径，不用绝对 URL**。在隧道后面，应用看到的 `Host` 是它自己的绑定地址，于是 `new URL('/login', "
"request.nextUrl)` 会变成 "
"`https://0.0.0.0:3001/login`，浏览器根本打不开。`NextResponse.redirect()` 只接受绝对 "
"URL，所以这个 handler 自己手写 `Location` 头。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:202
msgid "The trailing-slash interaction"
msgstr "尾斜杠重定向的冲突"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:204
msgid ""
"`skipTrailingSlashRedirect: true` is set globally in `next.config.js`, "
"because proxied applications own their path semantics. Next normally "
"redirects a trailing slash away; pgAdmin (Flask) or the agent web app may"
" add one back. Left on, the two layers can bounce a browser between them "
"forever. A proxied path has to reach its upstream exactly as the browser "
"asked for it."
msgstr ""
"`next.config.js` 里全局设置了 `skipTrailingSlashRedirect: "
"true`，因为被代理的应用应该自己决定路径的含义。Next 默认会通过重定向去掉尾斜杠，而 pgAdmin（Flask）或 agent "
"网页应用可能又把它加回来。如果保留 Next "
"的默认行为，浏览器就可能在这两层之间来回跳转，永远停不下来。被代理的路径必须原封不动地按浏览器请求的样子送到上游。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:210
msgid ""
"Skipping the redirect everywhere would change every other URL on the "
"site, so `apps/frontend/src/middleware.ts` reimplements the redirect for "
"everything *except* the `/pgadmin` and `/agents` prefixes — a 308 to the "
"slash-less path, built from `new URL(request.url)` rather than "
"`nextUrl.clone()` (a cloned `NextURL` remembers the incoming trailing "
"slash and re-serializes it, redirecting the request to exactly where it "
"already is)."
msgstr ""
"但如果在所有地方都跳过这个重定向，站点上其他所有 URL 的行为都会变，所以 `apps/frontend/src/middleware.ts` "
"为 `/pgadmin` 和 `/agents` 前缀*以外*的所有路径重新实现了这个重定向：用 308 跳到去掉尾斜杠的路径。目标 URL 是用"
" `new URL(request.url)` 而不是 `nextUrl.clone()` 构造的——克隆出来的 `NextURL` "
"会记住请求带来的尾斜杠，并在序列化时加回去，结果把请求重定向到它原本所在的地址。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:305
msgid ""
"The gateway's paths do not pass through the middleware (it would copy "
"their bodies), so a gateway path that ends in a slash gets its redirect "
"from `redirects()` in `next.config.js`: a `308` to the same path without "
"its last slash, as a bare path. Under the `entry_split` prefixes the "
"gateway gives the same answer itself, because there a request may reach "
"it without passing the console. Left to Starlette it would answer `307` "
"with an absolute `Location` built from the `Host` it received and the "
"scheme it saw, which behind a TLS-terminating entry is `http`."
msgstr ""
"网关的路径不经过中间件（中间件会拷贝它们的请求体），所以以斜杠结尾的网关路径由 `next.config.js` 的 `redirects()` "
"重定向：`308` 到去掉最后一个斜杠的同一路径，以裸路径给出。在 `entry_split` "
"前缀下，网关自己给出同样的回答，因为那里的请求可能不经过控制台就到达网关。如果交给 Starlette，它会回答 `307`，`Location`"
" 是用它收到的 `Host` 和它看到的协议拼出的绝对地址，而在终止 TLS 的入口后面，那个协议是 `http`。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:217
msgid "Adding a public path"
msgstr "新增一条公开路径"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:316
msgid ""
"Add the path to `deploy/public-paths.json`. Mark it `entry_split` only "
"when the deployments that split their entry are to send it to the gateway"
" directly; that is a new split prefix, and each of them reruns the probe."
msgstr ""
"把路径加入 `deploy/public-paths.json`。只有当分流入口的部署要把它直接交给网关时，才标记 "
"`entry_split`；那是一个新的分流前缀，每个这样的部署都要重新运行探针。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:219
msgid ""
"Choose the routing mechanism. A gateway path that takes a request body is a "
"route handler: a `route.ts` that exports `gatewayRoute('<its prefix>')`, "
"from `src/lib/server/gatewayProxy.ts`, for every method. A gateway path that"
" only answers `GET` may instead be a static rule in `rewrites()` in "
"`apps/frontend/next.config.js`. Write a handler of its own when the target "
"must remain configurable after build or the request needs application logic."
msgstr ""
"选择路由机制。带请求体的网关路径用 route handler：写一个 `route.ts`，为每个方法都导出 `gatewayRoute('<its "
"prefix>')`（来自 `src/lib/server/gatewayProxy.ts`）。只响应 `GET` 的网关路径，也可以改用 "
"`apps/frontend/next.config.js` 中 `rewrites()` "
"里的一条静态规则。如果目标在构建之后还要能改，或者请求需要应用逻辑，就单独写一个 handler。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:222
msgid ""
"Name it specifically. Prefer `/prefix/thing` over `/prefix/:path*` unless"
" every current and future route under that prefix is authorized by "
"construction."
msgstr ""
"路径要写具体。优先用 `/prefix/thing`，而不是 "
"`/prefix/:path*`，除非这个前缀下现有和将来的每条路由都从结构上保证了鉴权。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:225
msgid ""
"If the path needs a check the destination cannot make for itself, it is a"
" route handler, not a rewrite."
msgstr "如果这条路径需要一次目标服务自己做不了的检查，那它就该是 route handler，而不是 rewrite。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:227
msgid ""
"Rebuild the console for a source or rewrite-table change. After that "
"image is deployed, a runtime handler's target can be changed by "
"recreating its container; a static rewrite target still requires another "
"image build."
msgstr ""
"改了源码或 rewrite 表，就要重新构建控制台。新镜像部署之后，运行时 handler 的目标只需重新创建容器就能修改；静态 rewrite "
"的目标则仍然要重新构建镜像。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:333
msgid ""
"Add the path to the table above. The tests named under [The manifest"
"](#the-manifest) fail until the manifest, the route files, "
"`next.config.js` and the middleware's `matcher` agree."
msgstr ""
"把路径加入上面的表。在清单、route 文件、`next.config.js` 和中间件的 `matcher` 一致之前，[清单](#the-"
"manifest)一节列出的测试都会失败。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`/internal/alert-history/events`"
msgstr "`/internal/alert-history/events`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"alert-history ingestion from external sources (`POST`; scoped writer token, "
"`404` while off — see [Alert history](alert-history.md))"
msgstr ""
"外部来源的告警历史接收（`POST`；使用有范围限制的写入令牌，关闭时返回 `404`——见 [告警历史](alert-history.md)）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The table below is generated from "
#~ "the `rewrites()` function in "
#~ "`apps/frontend/next.config.js`. That file is "
#~ "the source of truth; if the two"
#~ " disagree, the file is right. "
#~ "Regenerate this section when you change"
#~ " it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "下面的表格由 `apps/frontend/next.config.js` 中的 "
#~ "`rewrites()` 函数生成。那个文件才是事实来源；两者不一致时以文件为准。改了它就重新生成本节。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Destination hosts come from environment "
#~ "variables. Next resolves `rewrites()` at "
#~ "**build** time and writes the result "
#~ "into `.next/routes-manifest.json`, so these"
#~ " are build args, not runtime "
#~ "environment: a value supplied only at"
#~ " `docker run` is read by nothing, "
#~ "and the symptom is the old table"
#~ " continuing to serve while every "
#~ "variable looks correctly set in `docker"
#~ " inspect`. See the `frontend` service's "
#~ "`build.args` in `deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "目标主机来自环境变量。Next 在**构建**时解析 `rewrites()` 并把结果写进 "
#~ "`.next/routes-manifest.json`，所以这些是构建参数，而不是运行时环境：只在 `docker"
#~ " run` 时提供的值不会被任何东西读到，症状是 `docker inspect` "
#~ "里每个变量看着都设对了，服务的却仍是旧表。见 `deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml`"
