#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:204
msgid ""
"**Keep the app's cookies to the app.** It shares the console's origin, so"
" a cookie it sets on `/` reaches every console and API request, and one "
"named like the console's replaces it. `scopeProxiedSetCookie()` drops the"
" second kind and confines the first to `/pgadmin`, without a `Domain`."
msgstr ""
"**把应用的 cookie 留在应用里**。它与控制台同源，所以它在 `/` 上设置的 cookie 会随每个控制台请求和 API "
"请求发送，而与控制台 cookie 同名的 cookie 会把后者替换掉。`scopeProxiedSetCookie()` "
"丢弃后一种，并把前一种限定在 `/pgadmin` 下，且不带 `Domain`。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:88
msgid ""
"Hop-by-hop headers are removed, and redirects that name either internal "
"agent service are folded back through its public prefix. The agent's own "
"cookies pass in both directions; the console's session cookie is never "
"forwarded to it. A cookie the agent sets under one of the console's names"
" is dropped, and the rest are confined to `/agents` (a `__Host-` cookie "
"keeps the `Path=/` browsers require of it)."
msgstr ""
"逐跳（hop-by-hop）头会去掉；如果重定向指向任一 agent 内部服务，会改写回对应的公开前缀下。agent 自己的 cookie "
"双向传递；控制台的会话 cookie 永远不会转发给它。agent 以控制台的某个 cookie 名称设置的 cookie "
"会被丢弃，其余的则被限定在 `/agents` 下（`__Host-` cookie 保留浏览器对它要求的 `Path=/`）。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:97
msgid ""
"Every gateway path that takes a request body is forwarded by a route handler"
" rather than a rewrite. A rewrite copies the body: Next holds a copy of "
"every rewritten request body in memory until the request ends, and stops "
"copying at `middlewareClientMaxBodySize`, so a rewrite either cuts a large "
"body short or lets any caller pin that much of the console's memory per "
"request. A route handler streams the body to the gateway as it arrives and "
"holds none of it."
msgstr ""
"凡是带请求体的网关路径，都由 route handler 转发，而不是 rewrite。rewrite 会复制请求体：Next 会把每个经 "
"rewrite 转发的请求体复制一份放在内存里，直到请求结束，复制到 `middlewareClientMaxBodySize` 就停下。所以 "
"rewrite 要么把大请求体截断，要么让任何调用方每个请求都能占住控制台这么多内存。route handler "
"则在请求体到达时就把它流式转给网关，自己一点也不留。"

